clock   | [*]:16 | % | % | % |

pattern sting tempo=96 swing=0
harmony | Am |
lead    | E4:16 |
pad     | [*]:16 |
bass    | A2:16 |
brass   | [*]:16 |
clock   | A5:16 |

pattern fanfare tempo=96 swing=0
harmony | Am | F | C | Em |
lead    | E4:4 C5:4 A4:4 E4:4 | A4:4 C5:4 F4:4 A4:4 | E4:4 G4:4 C5:4 E4:4 | B4:4 G4:4 E4:8 |
pad     | [*]:16 | % | % | % |
bass    | A2:8 E2:8 | F2:8 C2:8 | C2:8 G2:8 | E2:8 B1:8 |
keys    | [*]:4 .:4 [*]:4 .:4 | % | % | [*]:8 .:8 |
hat     | x.x. x... x.x. x... | % | x.x. x.x. x.x. xxxx | x... .... .... .... |
kick    | X... .... X... .... | X... .... X... ..x. | X... .... X... X... | X... .... .... .... |
snare   | .... X... .... X... | % | .... X... .... xXxX | .... .... .... x... |
brass   | [*]!:4 .:4 [*]:4 .:4 | [*]:4 .:4 [*]:8 | [*]:4 [*]:4 [*]:8 | [*]:8 .:8 |
clock   | E5:4 A5:4 C6:4 E5:4 | A5:4 C6:4 F5:4 A5:4 | E5:4 G5:4 C6:4 E5:4 | B5:4 G5:4 E5:8 |

cue explore
beds gale=0.6
play intro
loop A A2 B {C C2}

cue combat
beds gale=0.22
play fightin
loop fightA fightB fightC fightD

cue victory
beds gale=0.4
play fanfare
then explore

switch explore -> combat at bar via hit fade 0.4
switch combat -> explore at pattern fade 2
switch * -> victory at beat via sting fade 0.8
switch victory -> explore at bar fade 2
